### Personal Finance Coach - End-to-End Test Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Register a New User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@finance.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 2. Login to get JWT Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@finance.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### Capture JWT Token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Seed Demo Ledger (4 months of data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/seed
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Living Money Model (The dynamic engine)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/model
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. List Transactions (with category filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?category=FOOD&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Record a New Expense (Demonstrating dynamic model change)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "description": "Team Dinner at Smoke House Deli",
  "transactionDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### 8. Re-check Living Money Model (Proof numbers updated dynamically)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/model
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Get Budget Status (Alerts on exceeded categories)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. List Financial Goals
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. AI Coach - Chat (Grounded in real numbers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Where am I overspending the most, and can I afford a ₹25,000 purchase?"
}

### 12. AI Coach - Monthly Insights
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/insights
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. AI Coach - Deep Spending Analysis
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. AI Coach - 50/30/20 Budget Suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/budget-suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. AI Coach - 3-Month Financial Forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/forecast?months=3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
